ourcegames/games/languages.html#c\" data-external=\"1\">A list of C open-source games and frameworks</a> — at GitHub.io\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"Operating system","id":"Operating_system"},{"depth":2,"text":"Graphical user interface","id":"Graphical_user_interface"},{"depth":2,"text":"Gtk+ widgets","id":"Gtk.2B_widgets"},{"depth":2,"text":"Microsoft Excel","id":"Microsoft_Excel"},{"depth":2,"text":"Audio","id":"Audio"},{"depth":2,"text":"Video","id":"Video"},{"depth":2,"text":"Files","id":"Files"},{"depth":2,"text":"Maths","id":"Maths"},{"depth":2,"text":"Graphics","id":"Graphics"},{"depth":2,"text":"Generic","id":"Generic"},{"depth":2,"text":"Interprocess","id":"Interprocess"},{"depth":2,"text":"Databases","id":"Databases"},{"depth":2,"text":"Configuration","id":"Configuration"},{"depth":2,"text":"Environment","id":"Environment"},{"depth":2,"text":"Communications","id":"Communications"},{"depth":2,"text":"Compression","id":"Compression"},{"depth":2,"text":"Concurrency","id":"Concurrency"},{"depth":2,"text":"Data types","id":"Data_types"},{"depth":2,"text":"PDF","id":"PDF"},{"depth":2,"text":"XML","id":"XML"},{"depth":2,"text":"Metrics","id":"Metrics"},{"depth":2,"text":"Object oriented programming","id":"Object_oriented_programming"},{"depth":2,"text":"Web Frontend","id":"Web_Frontend"},{"depth":2,"text":"Debug","id":"Debug"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"},{"depth":3,"text":"External links","id":"External_links"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"links","title":"Useful resources"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"A list of open source C libraries","children":[{"label":"Operating system","children":[{"label":"Access control"},{"label":"Extended attributes"}]},{"label":"Graphical user interface"},{"label":"Gtk+ widgets"},{"label":"Microsoft Excel"},{"label":"Audio","children":[{"label":"Codecs"},{"label":"Infrastructure"},{"label":"Speech synthesis"}]},{"label":"Video","children":[{"label":"Codecs"}]},{"